stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING : 平台授权登录后由后端生成绑定申请<br/>（前端不创建绑定，只在回调页提示等待审批）

    PENDING --> APPROVED : reviewBinding(id, {approved: true, version})
    PENDING --> REJECTED : reviewBinding(id, {approved: false, version})

    APPROVED --> REVOKED : DELETE /bindings/{id}/unbind?version=

    APPROVED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    REVOKED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING
        过滤枚举 PENDING/APPROVED/REJECTED/REVOKED
        列表走 GET /admin-api/v1/office/bindings/page
        （platform 必选、status 可选，返回真实 total）
        旧的 /bindings 数组口径仍并存
    end note

    note right of APPROVED
        审批与解绑都携带 version 乐观锁
        版本冲突由后端拒绝，前端展示错误并重查
    end note